WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:00.875
To sum up.

2
00:00:00.875 --> 00:00:04.656
You checked nine Kerberos
accounts in a fictional domain,

3
00:00:04.656 --> 00:00:08.830
read a plan with four writes, an
island list and a reconciliation,

4
00:00:08.830 --> 00:00:13.713
applied the plan to a fake by its hash,
and saw a plan nobody approved refused.

5
00:00:13.713 --> 00:00:19.349
The evidence an ISSO keeps for Gate 5 from
this module is the plan with its approved

6
00:00:19.349 --> 00:00:23.078
hash, the findings, the island
list, the reconciliation,

7
00:00:23.078 --> 00:00:28.051
and the apply folder's results and
manifest, all dated, and the test result.

8
00:00:28.051 --> 00:00:31.125
Before you ship, work through
the chapter's checklist.

9
00:00:31.125 --> 00:00:35.400
Next is Module 9: govern
AI agent identities.

10
00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:40.847
Agents follow every gate you've done so far,
and add three things: an agent can act,

11
00:00:40.847 --> 00:00:45.940
a blueprint holds every agent's
credentials, and creation has to be gated.
